My personal website, designed without a framework, and pretty much from scratch. Everything is pre-rendered (currently), and my blog uses a [custom blog post format](https://github.com/search?q=user%3Atanishqkancharla+tk-parser).

The setup is very similar to Next.js with the /pages directory corresponding to pages on the website. These can either be .tk or .tsx files (which can use getStaticProps).
